{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:p008","quote":"先黥布反時，高祖嘗病甚，惡見人，臥禁中，詔戶者無得入群臣。群臣絳、灌等莫敢入。十餘日，噲乃排闥直入，大臣隨之。上獨枕一宦者臥。噲等見上流涕曰：「始陛下與臣等起豐沛，定天下，何其壯也！今天下已定，又何憊也！且陛下病甚，大臣震恐，不見臣等計事，顧獨與一宦者絕乎？且陛下獨不見趙高之事乎？」高帝笑而起。"}],"rationale":"按本篇分傳、明示姓名與敘事承接限定異稱。酈寄字況據第14段；夏侯嬰的嬰限定第16至21段，灌嬰限定第22至33段，桓嬰另人。第6與20、28段楚王信和反韓王信分人；未詳名王侯不補名。同名跨篇同指另待逐項證據。"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:p008","text":"先黥布反時，高祖嘗病甚，惡見人，臥禁中，詔戶者無得入群臣。群臣絳、灌等莫敢入。十餘日，噲乃排闥直入，大臣隨之。上獨枕一宦者臥。噲等見上流涕曰：「始陛下與臣等起豐沛，定天下，何其壯也！今天下已定，又何憊也！且陛下病甚，大臣震恐，不見臣等計事，顧獨與一宦者絕乎？且陛下獨不見趙高之事乎？」高帝笑而起。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m008-0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"黥布","kind":"person","person_id":"664_wah_z4z","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m008-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"高祖","kind":"person","person_id":"vok_rjp_tag","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m008-0031","start":31,"end":32,"surface":"絳","kind":"person","person_id":"s8n_dgg_60b","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m008-0033","start":33,"end":34,"surface":"灌","kind":"person","person_id":"mdl_l60_pwy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m008-0043","start":43,"end":44,"surface":"噲","kind":"person","person_id":"d9y_q1n_fte","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m008-0063","start":63,"end":64,"surface":"噲","kind":"person","person_id":"d9y_q1n_fte","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m008-0135","start":135,"end":137,"surface":"趙高","kind":"person","person_id":"jyd_5a2_cil","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang:m008-0142","start":142,"end":144,"surface":"高帝","kind":"person","person_id":"vok_rjp_tag","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-095-fankuang","book_id":"b-shiji-095","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-095-fankuang"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-s